lines=['# R3 paired benchmark and complete source review','',f'Runtime under review: main `abc33af` versus candidate `18dde3c`. Precision correction: `{head[:7]}`. Merge `cdb2d12` includes fix-large-company-site; search-engine removal is `fc26f04`. Nothing pushed; main and fix-large-company-site refs unchanged.','', '## Input and execution','', 'The existing cached fixed-seed 20261103 Builderr cohort was available on this laptop and frozen as `bench/inputs/1000-r3/batch.jsonl`: 1,000 distinct valid input records, SHA-256 `7ba0c3263afbca7dc5277f21f265e60484a937c59dc1871e9f1e0260d9bfe782`. It was not redrawn. The old Step 20 raw input was not present at its archived path, so byte equality to that specific historical run is not asserted. Both R3 runs use the exact frozen bytes.','', 'At least 10 GiB free was checked before both runs (65,174,331,392 bytes baseline; 63,470,505,984 candidate). Runs were sequential, each with empty state, no bulk CSV and default budgets. Key/token/secret and provider environment variables were stripped. NAV uses the public-token path. Both runs used:', '', '```sh','uv run --frozen signalpost run --organisations bench/inputs/1000-r3/batch.jsonl --output <run>/envelopes.jsonl --profiles-output <run>/profiles.jsonl --report <run>/report.json --state-dir <run>/state --site-dir <run>/site','```','', 'Baseline was an isolated local clone at main abc33af; candidate was more-websites. Frozen installation succeeded. Each run produced exactly one envelope and profile for every input, in input order. Both exited 0. Wall time includes startup, source collection, synthesis, output and site publishing. Sources are live and may vary between sequential runs; this is not an offline controlled network replay.','', '## Live measurements before precision corrections','', '| Metric | Main abc33af | Candidate 18dde3c |','|---|---:|---:|']
