for title,key in metrics:
 a=s['baseline'][key];b=s['candidate'][key]
 if isinstance(a,float):a=f'{a:.3f}';b=f'{b:.3f}'
 lines.append(f'| {title} | {a} | {b} |')
lines+=['| Site warnings | none | none |','| All report warnings | none | none |','| Envelopes / profiles | 1000 / 1000 | 1000 / 1000 |','', 'Facts are distinct `(orgnr, field, JSON value, reporting period)` among available non-null claims, not evidence/citation counts. The 3 jobs companies include actual NAV/company-site job records; landing pages do not count.','', 'Raw gains: 23 website companies; 20 social companies and 58 profile additions across 34 companies (including existing social companies). No raw baseline website company was lost. Nuve AS changed apex to www with identical body SHA-256 and exact orgnr proof.','', '### New websites by proof and source','', '| Raw proof type | Count |','|---|---:|']
