lines+=['', 'The conservative fact total is below baseline because some previously supported site facts are withheld with those sites and social aliases are dropped. This projection does not prove a no-regression coverage gate; no such gate is claimed.','', '## Cleanup and retained artifacts','', 'No search-engine integration remains. Deleted `src/signalpost/web/search.py`, `tests/test_search.py`, `tests/test_optional_brave.py`, `tests/test_bench_search_environment.py`; removed only its mock test from mixed `tests/test_web.py`, preserving its activity/website tests. Search-only CLI/config/env/benchmark switches and source-document references were removed. `rg -n -i "brave|search_api|api_key" src tests docs README.md SUBMISSION.md` returns no hits. TED structured procurement queries and local offline-site search are unchanged. Compatibility zero-search cost metrics remain constants; no adapter or provider/environment reader remains.','', 'Hard caps unchanged: 40 HTTP/company, pooled 18/distinct input, 2400 s run default. No runtime-specific company exceptions. Source outputs/state/site and isolated baseline checkout are ignored under bench/runs and the raw folder; committed reports contain only derived metadata and short source excerpts. Unrelated pre-existing overnight-worker files are not included.','', 'Reproduction:', '', '```sh','uv run pytest -q','uv run python scripts/r3_analyze.py --baseline bench/runs/r3-baseline --candidate bench/runs/r3-candidate --output bench/reports/r3-benchmark','uv run python scripts/r3_rederive.py','uv run python scripts/r3_review.py','uv run python scripts/r3_finalize_report.py','```','', 'Analyzer recreates the raw review inputs; run review after it to restore the manual verdict ledger. Manual verdicts in r3_review.py document this fixed cohort, never production exceptions. Projection is an analytical lower bound, not new evaluator profiles or a regenerated site.','']
